#: general.ui:26
msgid "Sort By:"
msgstr "Sorteren na:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, sortType)
#. +> trunk
#: general.ui:39
msgid ""
"Change the current sorting method.\n"
"\n"
"Priority:\n"
"Items are first sorted by their priority (1, 2, 3, none) and secondly by due date.\n"
"\n"
"Due Date:\n"
"Items are first sorted by their due date and secondly by priority."
msgstr ""
"De aktuelle Sorteermetood ännern..\n"
"\n"
"Prioriteet:\n"
"Indrääg warrt toeerst na ehr Prioriteet (1, 2, 3, keen) un denn na ehr Afloopdatum sorteert.\n"
"\n"
"Afloopdatum:\n"
"Indröög warrt toeerst na ehr Afloopdatum un denn na ehr Prioriteet sorteert."

